Lumi prompt_inputs_missing：提示词缺少任务输入 missing prompt placeholders: generated_summaries_json；用 prompt_catalog 查看占位符，在 variables 中补齐。
调用修正规则与 schema：
{"tool":{"name":"render_prompt","description":"Render an effective catalog template with project context and output requirements for the current Cindy Agent to execute. Returns a self-contained task, target UUID, expected_revision and write instructions. No provider is called. Supply missing task inputs in variables. Narrow context_chapter_uuids/context_setting_uuids if the result is too large.","input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"allOf":[{"if":{"properties":{"target":{"enum":["chapter","pages","page"],"type":"string"}}},"then":{"required":["chapter_uuid"]}},{"if":{"properties":{"target":{"enum":["page"],"type":"string"}}},"then":{"required":["page_uuid"]}},{"if":{"properties":{"target":{"enum":["setting"],"type":"string"}}},"then":{"required":["setting_uuid"]}}],"properties":{"chapter_uuid":{"description":"Public UUIDv7 from a previous read.","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-7[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"},"context_chapter_uuids":{"description":"Limit prompt context to these resources; [] omits the collection. Default: all. The write target is always included separately.","items":{"description":"Public UUIDv7 from a previous read.","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-7[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"type":"array"},"context_setting_uuids":{"description":"Limit prompt context to these resources; [] omits the collection. Default: all. The write target is always included separately.","items":{"description":"Public UUIDv7 from a previous read.","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-7[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"type":"array"},"page_uuid":{"description":"Public UUIDv7 from a previous read.","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-7[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"},"prompt_group":{"enum":["story","chapter","premise","premise_style","agent","runtime"],"type":"string"},"prompt_key":{"description":"Key from prompt_catalog.","maxLength":120000,"type":"string"},"setting_uuid":{"description":"Public UUIDv7 from a previous read.","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-7[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"},"target":{"enum":["setup","story_profile","chapter","pages","page","setting","premise"],"type":"string"},"variables":{"additionalProperties":{"description":"Template task input; authoritative project context cannot be overridden.","maxLength":120000,"type":"string"},"type":"object"}},"required":["prompt_group","prompt_key","target"],"type":"object"}},"rules":["只使用本目录工具与 JSON 对象参数。UUID 必须来自当前项目读取，不能使用内部 id。","版本冲突时保留已有内容，重读目标后再判断；取消、超时或 result_unknown 后先核对状态，禁止自动重写。","列表使用 cursor_pagination；result_too_large 时减小 limit 或上下文范围，不截断正文。完整流程见当前插件 authoring/MANUAL.md。","render_prompt 是业务提示词唯一来源，返回完整任务、目标 UUID、expected_revision 和写回契约；当前 Agent 执行后调用业务工具保存。page / setting 可渲染图片提示词；生图由当前 Agent 执行，不启动 Lumi pipeline。setting_board / setting_breakdown 尚未开放。","所有传入的目标与 context UUID 必须属于当前项目；page_uuid 同时需要 chapter_uuid。不存在或跨项目的上下文 UUID 会拒绝，不默默忽略。"],"discovery":{"tool":"list_tools","args":{"category":"prompts"}}}
